---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="订阅成功"
  description="你已成功订阅为何是祂的文章更新。"
  lang="zh"
  path="/subscribe/confirmed/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="confirmation-page" aria-labelledby="confirmation-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">邮件订阅</p>
    <h1 id="confirmation-heading">订阅成功</h1>
    <p>你的邮箱已经确认。以后有新文章时，我们会通过邮件通知你。</p>
    <p class="note">你可以随时使用邮件底部的退订链接取消订阅。</p>
    <a class="back-link" href="/zh/">返回“为何是祂”</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .confirmation-page { max-width: 680px; margin-inline: auto; padding: 96px 24px 120px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 44px); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .eyebrow, .note { color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .note { font-size: 14px; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
